{"range": [7, 7], "summary": "步骤7：read doc_3行783-786 确认 H 标题＝「Graduating together: the experience in graduate school of first-generation minority women who participated in an academic support program」(Article)，以“the experience”措辞疑为定性研究，待证实。当前分界：doc_1: A=1-710/B=711-1769/C=1770-2348；doc_2: D=1-532/E=533-1475/F=1476-1881；doc_3: G=1-782/H=783-1282。已定：B=定量观察性(2年随访)、C=定量观察性(匹配队列)、E=随机试验/方案(SINFONIA)、G=定性；D=疑随机试验(doc_2有36处randomi匹配但需归属行号)；A/F/H 方法未定。若A=定性则簇为(随机:D,E)25%/(定量:B,C,F)37.5%/(定性:A,G,H)37.5%；若A=定量则(随机:D,E)25%/(定量:A,B,C,F)50%/(定性:G,H)25%。"}
<motivation>还需确定 A、D、F、H 四篇的方法论（A 的归属直接改变簇比例）。用一次 llm_query locate 全库定位每篇字母标题论文的方法学证据（设计关键词），一次性解决四个未知并交叉验证已定的四篇。
</motivation>
<tool_call>
{"name": "llm_query", "mode": "locate", "documents": ["doc_1", "doc_2", "doc_3"], "query": "This corpus contains 8 research papers labeled A–H; each paper starts with a single-letter line like 'A.', 'B.', ... followed by its title. For each paper visible in this chunk, report: the paper letter, its title, and its research methodology category — one of: Randomized trial/protocol (RCT, study protocol, randomized experiment), Quantitative observational (cohort, follow-up, cross-sectional, case-control, matched cohort, retrospective chart/record review, survey with statistical analysis), or Qualitative (interviews, grounded theory, phenomenology, focus groups, qualitative analysis). Cite the exact methodology/design keywords and line numbers found (e.g., 'randomised controlled trial', 'matched cohort study', 'qualitative study', 'semi-structured interviews', 'retrospective review'). List findings as: LETTER | title | category | evidence keywords | line numbers."}
</tool_call>
